{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "編み込みこし取ばいな止まってけみ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963534.352054}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "て", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963539.3334036}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "皆さん、こんにちは。株式会社", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963550.4662468}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "サクラサクラプラス代表の中山です。本日は2026年7月", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963554.0094295}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "期、第3四半期決算についてご案内申し上げます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963558.5457587}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は二千二十六年七月期第三四半期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963562.103579}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "決算概要についてお知らせいたします。売上高につい", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963566.152447}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は百三十六億七千九百万となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963569.804577}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年同期比五点四パーセントの減収となりました。これは", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963573.3248477}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "既存円の在籍率向上や工程価格の上昇による", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963578.2059228}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "補助金増額、保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963582.515548}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "主力の保育サービスにおいて増収となりました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963587.3271215}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一方不動産事業は前期に計上した", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963590.7290912}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "大型不動産売却案件の反動により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963595.167496}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当期も不動産売却は実施したものの", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963598.2727563}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "全体としては減少となりました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963598.9064543}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なお、その他サービスは概ね計画どり進捗しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963603.864881}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は十億六千百万円となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963608.177206}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年同期比一点五パーセントの原因となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963610.4653654}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の撤退や中核事業の合理化", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963615.5048716}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963619.2899816}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "に向上", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963620.5737803}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "経常利益は十一億二千八百万円となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963625.4946804}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年同期比9。5の増益となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963628.102335}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "保育所の新規開設や蔵書の実施により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963633.0457072}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "これらに伴う開演前の補助金収入が加算されたことにより増益となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963636.15118}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ます。親会社株主に属する当期純利", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963640.1309862}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年度", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963643.4713094}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前期に計上した不採算事業の撤退に伴う特別損失がなくなったため", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963651.4956875}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "投機は増益となりました。続いて進捗", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963656.5160892}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "についてお知らせいたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963657.1424513}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "売上高は通期予算に対して", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963659.9510756}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "各サービス等も堅調に成長しており、当四半期累計機関におて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963667.9953723}
