{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は通期予算に対し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963672.4526696}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "対応のない成果や", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963677.453671}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の定義といった毎期継続している費用削減の施策が", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963681.578328}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "確実に成果を創出し、収益", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963686.1472807}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "が概ね予算通りに推移する中", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963686.7749162}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、これらの施策が利益の上振れをけん引し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963690.245242}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当四半期累計期間におて通期予算を前倒しして", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963695.1855338}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "達成しました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963696.6754909}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて貸借対照表", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963701.6954875}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "資産の分は販売に伴う販売用不動産の検証が", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963704.523682}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "補助金収入による未収入金の増加", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963709.396512}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不動産取得保育施設の新設増床による", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963712.4825284}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "資産合計は二十八億", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963717.592001}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "7100万円増加しました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963719.2236757}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "スタエノブは主に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963721.7130845}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "禁忌不動産", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963725.9034495}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "負債合計は二十一億三千三百万円増加しました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963733.3153327}
