{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。桜咲く未来晴海におても予定通り増長を行い", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963756.992217}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "自動定員数が増加しました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963759.3257504}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "他人口増加で保育所が不足してる晴海エリアから月島エリアへ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963764.3048153}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "親子で乗れる送迎バスの運行も開始しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963767.8933952}
