{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "1施設の新居保育所の開設を予定しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963777.1169803}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "フェムケア、フェムテックサービスにおいては、連結子会社のイェールにて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963780.7975607}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3.3-20260714-022524-7e5cd86e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "二千二十六年夏頃に新製品の発売を予定しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783963785.9070055}
